  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Heat radiates from the iron blade, as if the metal itself remembers a furnace. A searing, hungry flame clings to every strike, mending the spirit of the one who wields it with each blow. This is a relic of ruinous power, capable of carving through the strongest defenses."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Scratches and jagged nicks mar the wide blade, where old repairs have left uneven seams in the iron. The haft is slick with the sweat of many skirmishes and bears a balance that fits firmly in a warrior's grip."
    }
  },
